		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Horned human skeleton with yellow eyes. Swathed in black robes, carries a staff topped with the symbol of the Horseman of Death.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 staff +4 (2d4), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Animate Dead</strong>. Create 1d4 zombies or skeletons from corpses within far, disintegrate after 10 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Crush Soul Gem</strong>. Crush soul gem (see cacodaemon) to heal a daemon within close to full hit points.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
